# Large regenerable expression matrices for secondary pipeline variants.
# Only the primary run (data/pipeline/main/) ships its full matrices; for the
# sensitivity/comparison variants the DE tables and summaries are enough to
# reproduce every reported number, and the matrices are regenerated by
# `Rscript scripts/run_everything.R --full`.
